  "Number": 1,
  "Question": "What is \\((20-(2010-201))\\) \\(+(2010-(201-20))?\\)",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(-4020\\)",
    "B": "\\(0\\)",
    "C": "\\(40\\)",
    "D": "\\(401\\)",
    "E": "\\(4020\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "Subtracting a parenthesized difference changes the signs of both terms. Removing the parentheses therefore gives\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(20-2010+201)+(2010-201+20)\\\\\n&=20+20=\\boxed{40}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThe \\(2010\\) terms cancel, as do the \\(201\\) terms. The answer is choice \\(\\mathrm{C}\\).",
